			<div class="content" id="post-content-4851295">
									

<p>I think I misinterpreted this idea a little. On a second read, it's not that similar to the other SCP, but I still find the &quot;needing to sacrifice humans to feed the entity&quot; part a bit too generic. Also, what's preventing the Foundation from just killing the girl? Will the entity latch on to someone else? I think this needs a bit more detail.</p>
<p>If I had to make a suggestion, I think this would be more interesting if the entity was making the girl sick but killing everyone who tried to separate it from her. You could even add in a more sympathetic angle for the entity - maybe it really doesn't want to hurt the girl or anyone else, but it just naturally causes death? Something of that type would interest me more.</p>

