<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: A Tone that is estimated to emit a frequency of about 432.7&#160;Hz. The sound is immune to any sort of muffling via cognitive or physical means, and maintains an equal volume across a roughly 5 meter radius.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: A few research notes about the different properties of the sound, as it is both mobile and often hard to contain. The Foundation has decided to organize gatherings that create a large amount of noise in order to maintain containment, such as construction work or festivals. AWCY also plays a small part in this, as they occasionally try to create street music around the &quot;sound&quot;.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: A sound that follows none of the conventional laws of sonic physics, and is only perceptible by humans which creates some mystery around what it is.</p>
<p>Additional Notes: Deciding the class I feel might be a bit hard, as I feel like it may be Keter due to its generally hard to contain nature, however it could be Euclid I suppose too</p>

